   "lines": [
    "I row almost every",
    "day — either to Loyds",
    "neck or round Centre",
    "Island. If any of",
    "the boys stay up I",
    "generally play lawn",
    "tennis with them.",
    "I often take Motherling",
    "out walking, or ~~one~~",
    "Bysie or Pussie out",
    "rowing. I am teaching",
    "pretty Miss Emily",
    "Swan to play",
    "lawn tennis."
   ],
